OL,3,GNEWSASurrey station reaches 'World Cup'
OL,4,Afinal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey train station which recently
OL,7,Frevitalised its local environment has
OL,8,Fbeen shortlisted as a finalist in the
OL,9,F2026 "World Cup of Stations".
OL,11,FBrookwood station, near Woking, has
OL,12,Fmade it to a shortlist of five
OL,13,Ffinalists at this year's competition
OL,14,Fafter volunteers transformed unused
OL,15,Frailway land into a memorial garden.
OL,17,FYvonne Craven, a volunteer at the
OL,18,Fgarden, said she was "astonished" when
OL,19,Fshe found out about the shortlisting.
OL,21,F"I thought it must be some sort of
OL,22,Fjoke," she added.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
